  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Resilience through Early Warning System, Enhanced AA &amp; Multi-risk</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To reduce the vulnerability and improve the disaster preparedness and resilience of highly at -risk communities by strengthening capacities for disaster preparedness, anticipatory actions and rapid, inclusive humanitarian response in the Bangsamoro Autonomous Region in Muslim Mindanao (BARMM) and promote anticipatory action and strengthened Disaster Risk Reduction (DRR) policy at the sub -national, national and regional levels through platforms for coordination, advocacy and learning utilizing evidence gathered through this Action and related undertakings.</narrative>
  </description>
